OL,3,GNEWSADine-and-dashers demoralising
OL,4,Astaff, says industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising numbers of dine-and-dash thefts
OL,7,Ftargeting restaurants and other venues
OL,8,Fhave been leaving staff demoralised,
OL,9,Fbusiness owners have said.
OL,11,FFigures obtained by the BBC via a
OL,12,FFreedom of Information (FOI) request
OL,13,Fshow that offences reported to Norfolk
OL,14,FPolice have doubled in the past three
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,17,FLast year 60 dine-and-dash thefts were
OL,18,Freported to the force, compared with 29
OL,19,Fin 2023 - but less than 10% resulted in
OL,20,Fa charge.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
