OL,3,GNEWSADine-and-dashers demoralising
OL,4,Astaff, says industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FRebecca Mayhew, who suffered a spate of
OL,7,Fdine-and-dash thefts at her restaurant
OL,8,Fat Old Hall Farm in Woodton, Norfolk,
OL,9,Fthought the increase was down to a
OL,10,F"lapse of morals".
